WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:13.847
- Ready to go?

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:14.848
OK.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.588
We look for any contraband,
agricultural products,

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:25.558
narcotics, money, instruments
of terror, anything like that

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.360
prohibited from
the United States.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:35.235
So this morning we had an
express consignment flight

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.469
arrive from Germany.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.004
What we're going to
be doing is we're

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.639
going to utilize our
canine, and we're

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.541
physically going to
inspect the packages

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:43.143
and see what we come up with.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.345
Guys, let's just lay these
out in a straight line.

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:47.647
We have to work quickly,
because a lot of the packages

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.349
are overnight or
two-day shipping.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.251
So we have only a short
time before they need

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.821
to arrive at their destination.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.189
All right, bring him in.

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.631
- Bach is trained
on narcotics-- meth,

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:08.301
ecstasy, heroin, cocaine,
marijuana and hash,

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.502
and now fentanyl.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.111
[whistles]

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.282
An alert on his
package right here.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.784
- Let's take, take it
out, let him keep going.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:25.985
- That's a good boy.

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.054
Good boy.

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:32.892
[whistles] All right, good boy.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.227
Good to go.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.728
- We'll do an exam on
this table over here.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:48.975
Looks like we've
got two toy cars.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:50.410
A little bit of weight to it.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:57.383
Bingo!

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:02.288
Feels like pills.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:06.092
- All right, let's take a look.

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.361
- And yes, pills--

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:10.930
square pills, different colors.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.398
- We don't know what it is.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.434
Until we get a field test,
we don't know what it is.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:34.854
- We have a positive
response for ecstasy.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.826
The total weight is 114 grams.

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:45.298
These pills look like Pez candy.

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:48.334
A child gets a hold of
them, and one pill ingested

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:51.804
could be a fatal, a fatal dose.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.039
We'll wrap it up.

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:54.974
We'll make the phone
call the HSI, which

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:56.342
is our investigative unit.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:58.645
And they will find out
who's ordering this,

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:01.147
who's distributing
this, and ultimately we

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:03.516
want to put them in jail.

